<title>SOUTH KOREA: Coca-Cola says to invest $400 mln in S.Korea.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola says to invest $400 mln in S.Korea.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Co said it would invest more than $400 million in South Korea over the next five years to finance a new bottling system.</p>
</text>
